-- =============================================================================
-- 075_legacy_expenses.sql
-- OK Veggies. The September and October expense ledger, migrated from the
-- business's spreadsheet into the expenses table (PR1). Generated deterministic
-- data: one row per legacy purchase line, categorised by the enforced taxonomy,
-- amounts in integer kobo. Produce and goods bought to resell are cost of goods
-- (stock-purchase); the rest fall to their running-cost category.
--
-- Idempotent: each row carries a stable external_ref and the insert is
-- INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE on that unique key, so re-applying this
-- file changes nothing. source = 'migration' marks every row.
--
-- Reconciliation (verified against the spreadsheet Dashboard before commit):
--   total expenses  = NGN 8,258,725  (825,872,589 kobo)
--   September        = NGN 6,417,843
--   October          = NGN 1,840,882
-- See docs/EXPENSES_AND_REPORTING_ENGINEERING_GUIDE.md section 3.5.
-- =============================================================================

